  shooting: ['Lock and load! Test your aim and reflexes. Best free shooting game!', 'Precision and speed decide every match! Line up your shots and outsmart every opponent. Only the sharpest aim survives here.'],
  adventure: ['Epic adventure awaits! Explore worlds solve puzzles defeat bosses.', 'Step into a world full of mystery and danger! Explore hidden paths, solve tricky puzzles, and take on epic bosses along the way.'],
  io: ['Join thousands worldwide! Compete real-time and dominate leaderboard.', 'Jump into a live arena with players from around the globe! Grow, survive, and fight your way to the top of the leaderboard.'],
  '2player': ['Challenge a friend! Local multiplayer fun that never gets old.', 'Grab a friend and battle it out! Perfect for couch co-op or head-to-head competition on the same screen.'],
